<!DOCTYPES html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Miso Tofu Soup</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Miso Tofu Soup</h1>
      <p>A homemade recipe I learnt from my girlfriend</p>
    <h2>Ingredients</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Miso</li>
        <li>Tofu</li>
        <li>Vegetable (optional)</li>
        <li>Seaweed</li>
    <h2>Prep</h2>
      <p>Slice thin the tofu into small dice</p>
      <p>Thred seaweed</p>
    <h2>Cooking</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Boil water</li>
        <li>Put miso to taste</li>
        <li>Add diced Tofu</li>
        <li>Wait til boil again then turn off the head and add threded seaweed</li>
      </ol>
      </ul>
  </body>
</html>
